<title>UK: Ocean Group says trading meets expectations.</title>
<headline>Ocean Group says trading meets expectations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British marine and environmental services firm Ocean Group Plc said on Tuesday that trading so far this year had met its expectations.</p>
